  "authorModelFormulaQuestions": [
    "What does this author notice that another writer would overlook?",
    "How does the author transform observation into interpretation?",
    "What values, memories, culture, expertise and assumptions filter that interpretation?",
    "How does audience/relationship change expression?",
    "What does the author omit, soften, intensify, joke about or leave implicit?",
    "How does first-draft behavior differ from revision behavior?",
    "Which traits are stable versus context/emotion/medium dependent?",
    "What evidence distinguishes generative consistency from superficial lexical mimicry?",
    "What adversarial test would expose a bad author model?",
    "What next question/sample would reduce uncertainty the most?",
    "Can we separate author voice from topic/genre effects?",
    "Can we separate spontaneous speech from polished writing?",
    "Does the model generalize to unseen topics and audiences?",
    "Can it explain voice mismatch in author-correctable terms?",
    "Are contradictions genuine human variation rather than errors to flatten?",
    "Can feedback update the model without erasing prior approved versions?"
  ]
